      "text": "Tesla remains South Korea's #1 best-selling imported car brand for the NINTH consecutive month 🇰🇷\n\nOctober 2026 registrations:\n\n• Tesla: 9,165\n• Mercedes-Benz: 6,744\n• BMW: 5,633\n\nTesla outsold Mercedes-Benz by 2,421 vehicles and BMW by 3,532\n\nAnd the Model Y Premium dominated the imported-model rankings with 5,501 registrations on its own\n\nTesla's October sales more than DOUBLED year-over-year, surging 110.7%\n\nOnce, German luxury brands dominated South Korea's imported car market\n\nNow Tesla is leading it",
