      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Exactly 😂\n\nTesla has no government contracts and President Trump ended federal incentives for electric vehicles. \n\nSpaceX contracts with the government are BOTH the best product AND the lowest price! Moreover government revenue will be less than 10% of SpaceX revenue this quarter and less then 5% a year from now. \n\nHappy to cancel any that the government doesn’t want. Just say the word!",
      "quote": {
        "author": "WR4NYGov",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2094269019662798849/W_67we2g_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-06 22:54:33",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-06T14:54:33.000Z",
        "id": "2118718688748777545",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Warren Redlich - Chasing Dreams 🇺🇸",
        "text": "Elon please send this January 1:\n\nDear Senate & House Democrats,\n\nMany of you criticize my companies receiving federal contracts.\n\nI hereby offer to cancel.\n\nPlease publish a list of each contract to cancel with any required agency consent, and we will cancel promptly.",
        "url": "https://x.com/WR4NYGov/status/2118718688748777545",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
