      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-06 23:47:47",
      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "SpaceX will attempt to catch both the Super Heavy booster and Starship on the upcoming flight. \n\nIf both are successful, it will mark the first time that all parts of an orbital rocket return to Earth intact. \n\nThis is the critical breakthrough needed to make life multiplanetary.",
