            "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2025562330063679488/img/OE4-CreV6CRCD5-U.jpg",
            "type": "video",
            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2025562330063679488/vid/avc1/1080x1080/HGt_XiGPH2SnG7lC.mp4?tag=21",
            "width": 1080
          }
        ],
        "name": "X Freeze",
        "text": "Elon Musk predicts space will become the lowest-cost place to run superintelligence within just 2–3 years\n\n“I think the case is a no-brainer for building solar-powered AI data centers in space”\n\nSolar panels facing the Sun and radiators pointed away from it can provide an incredibly efficient power and cooling system\n\n“The net effect is that the lowest cost place to put AI will be space. And that'll be true within two years, maybe three at the latest”\n https://x.com/XFreeze/status/2025562440407335283/video/1",
        "url": "https://x.com/XFreeze/status/2118447208542662763",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
